# Hardware description: APX H743 Pro IO MCU (STM32F103, 72 MHz)
#
# Drives MAIN 1-8, reads RC input and the safety switch, and holds the outputs
# at their failsafe values if the main MCU stops talking. Linked to the H743's
# USART6 at 1.5 Mbaud (drivers/iomcu). Read by the GUI board diagram.

MCU STM32F1xx STM32F103xB
OSCILLATOR_HZ 24000000

# link to the main MCU
PA2 USART2_TX USART2
PA3 USART2_RX USART2

# MAIN 1-8
PA0 TIM2_CH1 TIM2 PWM(1)
PA1 TIM2_CH2 TIM2 PWM(2)
PB8 TIM4_CH3 TIM4 PWM(3)
PB9 TIM4_CH4 TIM4 PWM(4)
PA6 TIM3_CH1 TIM3 PWM(5)
PA7 TIM3_CH2 TIM3 PWM(6)
PB0 TIM3_CH3 TIM3 PWM(7)
PB1 TIM3_CH4 TIM3 PWM(8)

# RC input: PPM / SBUS on the timer input, DSM on USART1, SBUS out on USART3
PA8 RCIN TIM1_CH1 INPUT
PA10 USART1_RX USART1
PB10 USART3_TX USART3

# safety switch and its LED
PB5 SAFETY_INPUT INPUT PULLDOWN
PB13 SAFETY_LED OUTPUT LOW

# servo rail and RSSI sense
PA4 VSERVO ADC1
PA5 VRSSI ADC1

# status LEDs
PB14 LED_BLUE OUTPUT HIGH # blue: heartbeat
PB15 LED_AMBER OUTPUT HIGH # amber: failsafe

PA13 JTMS-SWDIO SWD
PA14 JTCK-SWCLK SWD
